# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# AMAZON.PH CREW — Environment Configuration
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your keys.

# ── OpenRouter Free LLM (REQUIRED) ──────────────────────────────────
# Get your API key: https://openrouter.ai/keys
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=yuor_openrouter_key_here

# Free model to use for all 7 agents.
# Available free models (OpenRouter, June 2026):
#   - meta-llama/llama-3.3-70b-instruct:free       (best quality)
#   - qwen/qwen3-coder:free                         (good for structured output)
#   - nousresearch/hermes-3-llama-3.1-405b:free     (high quality, slower)
#   - google/gemma-4-31b-it:free                    (latest, good analysis)
#   - cohere/north-mini-code:free                   (fast & lightweight)
OPENROUTER_FREE_MODEL=meta-llama/llama-3.3-70b-instruct:free

# ── Serper.dev API Key (REQUIRED for web search tools) ──────────────
# Get your key: https://serper.dev/
SERPER_API_KEY=your_serper_key_here
